<title>GERMANY: Metallgesellschaft profits up 71 pct - report.</title>
<headline>Metallgesellschaft profits up 71 pct - report.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metallgesellschaft AG will show a 71 percent increase in group earnings to 292 million marks for the 1995/96 fiscal year to September 30, the German newsletter Platow Brief reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the metals and trading group would not comment on the report, but said the company would make an announcement on Friday morning.</p>
<p>In the 1994/95 fiscal year, Metallgesellschaft reported group sales of 17.64 billion marks and a group net profit of 118 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
